{"id":"mentiroso","lemma":"mentiroso","pos":"adj","rank":1567,"glosses":["having the qualities of a liar","having lies"],"ipa":"/mentiˈɾoso/","forms":{"feminine":"mentirosa","masculinePlural":"mentirosos","femininePlural":"mentirosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mentiroso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es un mentiroso.","en":"He's a liar.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438476"},{"text":"¿Me estás llamando mentirosa?","en":"Are you calling me a liar?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/163073"},{"text":"Detesto a los mentirosos.","en":"I hate liars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438160"},{"text":"No soy ningún mentiroso.","en":"I'm no liar.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438361"},{"text":"¡Eres una mentirosa de mierda!","en":"You're a filthy liar!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/558923"}]}